### Scenario 31
### Penalty application fails, then operator retries the failed operation manually

### 31.1 Login as landlord, tenant, and admin
POST {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2
}

> {%
client.global.set("landlordToken", response.body.token);
%}

###

POST {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 4
}

> {%
client.global.set("tenantToken", response.body.token);
%}

###

POST {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 6
}

> {%
client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.token);
%}

### 31.2 Create claim with amount < 200 so async assessment skips additional-info
POST {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/claims
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{landlordToken}}

{
  "tenantUserId": 4,
  "title": "Dining chair leg snapped",
  "description": "Simple penalty flow for failure and recovery demo.",
  "claimedAmount": 120.00,
  "currency": "USD"
}

> {%
client.global.set("claimId31", response.body.id);
%}

### 31.3 Poll claim until status becomes AWAITING_TENANT_RESPONSE
GET {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/claims/{{claimId31}}
Authorization: Bearer {{landlordToken}}

### 31.4 Tenant responds
POST {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/claims/{{claimId31}}/tenant-response
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

{
  "agree": false,
  "comment": "I disagree and want support review."
}

### 31.5 Support decision requests penalty but simulates downstream failure
POST {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/claims/{{claimId31}}/support-decision
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "applyPenalty": true,
  "penaltyAmount": 84.00,
  "penaltyCurrency": "USD",
  "note": "Simulate failed external processor",
  "simulateFailure": true
}

### 31.6 Poll claim until status becomes PENALTY_PROCESSING_FAILED
GET {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/claims/{{claimId31}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 31.7 Inspect failed penalty operation
GET {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/penalties/claims/{{claimId31}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

> {%
client.global.set("failedOpId31", response.body[0].id);
%}

### 31.8 Retry the latest failed operation manually
POST {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/penalties/operations/{{failedOpId31}}/retry
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 31.9 Poll claim until status becomes PENALTY_APPLIED
GET {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/claims/{{claimId31}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 31.10 Inspect audit trail
GET {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/audit/claims/{{claimId31}}/events
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
